Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Walda's phrase in Japanese builds
Applies after 0063-japanese-trainer-hill.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

The Japanese ROM's phrase for Walda is 12 characters long (the save keeps the
international buffer) and takes any characters: each one's code minus 1 gives 6
bits of the wallpaper data, with no letter table and no check bits. Other
languages are unchanged.

diff --git a/include/walda_phrase.h b/include/walda_phrase.h
index 1cfd8af..7a252d9 100644
--- a/include/walda_phrase.h
+++ b/include/walda_phrase.h
@@ -1,8 +1,18 @@
 #ifndef GUARD_WALDA_PHRASE_H
 #define GUARD_WALDA_PHRASE_H
 
+#include "constants/global.h"
+
 #define WALDA_PHRASE_LENGTH 15
 
+// The Japanese ROM's phrase is 12 characters long (the save keeps the
+// international buffer).
+#if GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_JAPANESE
+#define WALDA_PHRASE_ENTRY_LENGTH 12
+#else
+#define WALDA_PHRASE_ENTRY_LENGTH WALDA_PHRASE_LENGTH
+#endif
+
 u16 TryBufferWaldaPhrase(void);
 void DoWaldaNamingScreen(void);
 u16 TryGetWallpaperWithWaldaPhrase(void);
